<blockquote>
<p>Wait, so Zyn is like batman? Does she have like, a Zynmobile or a Butterang?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Actually, the reference is from a conversation that happened in staffchat awhile back. Bryx posted for records-keeping:</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">I&nbsp;am&nbsp;the&nbsp;Night</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">BatZyn</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>&lt;djkaktus&gt; Checkin out these new articles.<br />
&lt;ProcyonLotor&gt; You have my sympathies.</p>
<ul>
<li>Viv_blogs looks up more info on HIV</li>
</ul>
<p>&lt;djkaktus&gt; Yeah dude it isn't good.<br />
&lt;ProcyonLotor&gt; Finally hit the wiki.<br />
&lt;Bryx&gt; I refuse to believe it's the end until Lowest Rated runs to a second page<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; oh god.<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; I hadnt ever thought of that.<br />
&lt;ProcyonLotor&gt; &#8230;</p>
<ul>
<li>ProcyonLotor [internal screaming]</li>
</ul>
<p>&lt;Viv_blogs&gt; Wow<br />
&lt;Viv_blogs&gt; Is that&#8230;<br />
&lt;Viv_blogs&gt; Is that even possible?<br />
&lt;Bryx&gt; No idea. It's got 13 on it at the moment<br />
&lt;FortuneFavorsBold&gt; jesus&#8230;<br />
&lt;FortuneFavorsBold&gt; &#8230;</p>
<ul>
<li>FortuneFavorsBold looks wistfully at &quot;Keter Cocks&quot;</li>
<li>FortuneFavorsBold wonders if he's the hero the wiki needs.</li>
</ul>
<p>&lt;Bryx&gt; It looks like the limit is 100<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; Still, jesus. Poor Zyn would have an aneurysm.<br />
&lt;Viv_blogs&gt; I'd fly out to California to provide emergency medical care.<br />
&lt;Viv_blogs&gt; And like fail because I am not a doctor<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; She would be forced to create multiple accounts<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; run them all through the process of becoming a mod</p>
<ul>
<li>ProcyonLotor is now known as ProcyonPing</li>
</ul>
<p>&lt;djkaktus&gt; just so that she could provide the votes she would need<br />
&lt;ProcyonPing&gt; Hahaha<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; to downvote and delete any article she comes across<br />
&lt;ProcyonPing&gt; We all turn a blind eye<br />
&lt;ProcyonPing&gt; Zyn assumes direct control<br />
&lt;Bryx&gt; She becomes the vigilante of the wiki<br />
&lt;Viv_blogs&gt; XD XD<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; We're all sitting around here like<br />
&lt;Viv_blogs&gt; She's not the hero the wiki deserves<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; &quot;who the fuck keeps deleting these things&quot;<br />
&lt;Viv_blogs&gt; She's the hero the wiki needs<br />
&lt;Bryx&gt; The Dark Moth Sock Puppet<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; and she's in chat going<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; &quot;&#8230;&quot;<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; &quot;I AM THE NIGHT&quot;<br />
&lt;@Silber&gt; &quot;We have no idea who is behind the mass-downvoting mod squad&quot;<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; &quot;Call Commissioner Mann, get him on the case.&quot;<br />
&lt;@Silber&gt; &quot;We have no idea why all the accounts have names like 'ButterflySoldierZeta4'&quot;<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; Little do we know Mann has a giant fucking butterfly signal on the top of Site 19.<br />
&lt;Bryx&gt; This needs to happen in fan art<br />
&lt;Bryx&gt; Forget Forum detectives<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; He's standing up there one night, with the signal on<br />
&lt;Bryx&gt; This must be documented<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; and Zyn appears behind him<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; doing the raspy voice thing Christian Bale thing<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; and she's like &quot;I saw the signal Commissioner. Where is the injustice?&quot;<br />
&lt;ProcyonPing&gt; <em>yes</em><br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; And Mann is like &quot;It's not good, BatZyn. Looks like we've got three new coldposts up in the last five minutes&quot;<br />
&lt;djkaktus&gt; And she's like &quot;<em>im fucking on it</em>&quot;<br />
